 </li><li> Steam friend matchmaking<br>  </li><li> Save and load multiplayer games for the quick lunch time battle<br>  </li><li> Enable shared unit control between allies.<br>  </li><li> Watch recorded multiplayer replays and save at any point to start playing from<br>  </li><li> Full cross-platform multiplayer between the Windows, Linux and Android versions</li></ul></li></ul>",
